      en: ["The university was officially founded in 1499 by Cardinal Cisneros.", "It is recognized as the first planned university city in world history.", "The iconic Plateresque facade of San Ildefonso was finished in 1553.", "The Great Hall hosts the annual Cervantes Prize ceremony every April 23rd.", "UNESCO declared the site a World Heritage Site in the year 1998.", "The famous Complutensian Polyglot Bible was compiled here between 1514 and 1517."],
